ur"}],[{"text":"Behavioural Economics"},{"text":"Decision science"}],[{"text":"Experimental Design"},{"text":"Behavioural research"}],[{"text":"Survey Design"},{"text":"Consumer/research roles"}],[{"text":"Data Visualisation"},{"text":"Research communication"}],[{"text":"AI/HCI"},{"text":"Future behavioural roles"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Certificates are secondary to actual research ability. A student with three strong experiments and a well-documented research portfolio can be more convincing than someone with many generic certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Behavioural Analyst"},{"text":"Behaviour + research + data"},{"text":"Behavioural research portfolio"}],[{"text":"Behavioural Research Assistant"},{"text":"Research + statistics"},{"text":"Research project"}],[{"text":"Behavioural Science Associate"},{"text":"Psychology + experiments"},{"text":"Behavioural case study"}],[{"text":"Research Associate"},{"text":"Research + analysis"},{"text":"Research portfolio"}],[{"text":"UX Research Assistant"},{"text":"Psychology + qualitative research"},{"text":"UX study"}],[{"text":"UX Researcher Trainee"},{"text":"Research + user behaviour"},{"text":"User research project"}],[{"text":"Consumer Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Psychology + marketing + data"},{"text":"Consumer study"}],[{"text":"Market Research Analyst"},{"text":"Survey + statistics"},{"text":"Survey project"}],[{"text":"People Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Psychology + HR + data"},{"text":"HR analytics project"}],[{"text":"Organisational Behaviour Associate"},{"text":"Psychology + workplace research"},{"text":"OB project"}],[{"text":"Behaviour Change Associate"},{"text":"Psychology + intervention"},{"text":"Behaviour-change study"}],[{"text":"Policy Research Associate"},{"text":"Behaviour + policy"},{"text":"Policy brief"}],[{"text":"Behavioural Economics Research Assistant"},{"text":"Economics + psychology + statistics"},{"text":"Experimental study"}],[{"text":"Customer Insights Analyst"},{"text":"Behaviour + analytics"},{"text":"Customer-data project"}],[{"text":"Product Research Associate"},{"text":"Psychology + product"},{"text":"Product research case"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"Behavioural Analyst is not one universally standardised entry-level title."},{"type":"p","text":"A BA Psychology graduate may enter through:"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Consumer Insights Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"UX Research Assistant"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"Behavioural Science Associate"},{"type":"p","text":"or"},{"type":"h","text":"People Analytics Analyst"},{"type":"p","text":"and later move into behavioural analysis."},{"type":"note","label":"Important distinction","text":"Applied Behaviour Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"If the student's intended career is specifically Applied Behaviour Analyst, working directly on behavioural interventions with clients, the student should not assume that a general BA Psychology automatically qualifies them."},{"type":"p","text":"That pathway can involve:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Specialised ABA coursework"},{"text":"Supervised practical experience"},{"text":"Professional certification where applicable"},{"text":"Employer/setting-specific requirements"},{"text":"Local regulatory requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The requirements differ between countries and professional systems."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG programme","Best use"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA/M.Sc Psychology"},{"text":"Advanced psychology"}],[{"text":"MA Applied Psychology"},{"text":"Applied behavioural work"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Behavioura